 one however in  the many calculations Trey misses one  the need to readjust the heat shield  that protects the ship from the sun's  radiation sounds important how did he  miss that this error is discovered when  there is an emergency declared by the  computer after slight damage to the heat  shield unfortunately the true extent of  the damage can only be assessed and  repaired by leaving the ship and working  out in space Captain Canada and Kappa  volunteer for the dangerous and start  the necessary preparations as the two  exit the ship in Eva suits to begin  repairs the pilot Cassie reorients The  Icarus 2 in order to provide the two  spacewalking astronauts as much shade as  she can she does this despite knowing  that it will result in the loss of the  two Communications Towers needed to  return to Earth later in no time the  tips of the com Towers burn up as they  continue to revolve around the living  quarters in and out of the sunlight  consequently Cassian weddingly sets off  another chain of events when the still  revolving and burning remnants of the  communications Tower causes a beam of  sunlight to deflect towards the center  of the ship and onto the oxygen Garden  soon a fire breaks out that burns down  the garden and threatens to engulf the  entire ship Corazon quickly rushes to a  rapidly burning garden and requests  entry thinking that she can save it  however mace weighs up the situation and  realizes that the mission and the ship  will be lost unless drastic action is  taken so he orders the computer to  release all the stored oxygen in the  tanks to provide such an enormous boost  to the fire that it will literally blow  itself out he also realizes that this  will completely destroy the garden  during this event the artificial  intelligence begins to take automatic  control of the Icarus too it also tries  to return the heat shield back to cover  the living quarters despite the fact  that it is currently protecting captain  and Kappa who are stil